⍝ Fix the namespace in the file named by $QR_SOURCE, encode each [level,text]
⍝ pair in cases.json, and write the rows (or the error message) to out.json.
⎕FIX'file://',2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' 'QR_SOURCE'
cases←⎕JSON⊃⎕NGET'cases.json'
out←{l t←⍵ ⋄ 0::'ERROR ',⎕DMX.EM ⋄ ↓l qr.QR t}¨cases
(⎕JSON out)⎕NPUT'out.json' 1
